# C Code Documentation Rules
*.c, *.h
- Document every function with detailed descriptions, parameters, return values, and relationships to other functions
- Identify global variables and explain their purpose
- Trace data structures and how they interact
- Explain complex algorithms
- Document game mechanics implementations
- Identify file dependencies and inclusions
- Follow roguelike game conventions in explanations
- Consider Windows-specific dependencies and compilation requirements